                          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                          "width": "fill_container",
                          "content": "When the weather turns halfway through a Super Randonneur series, your kit matters more than ever. I learned it the hard way on the Polesie 600: eleven hours of rain, a 4 °C night and 180 km still to go.",
