                          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                          "width": "fill_container",
                          "content": "A rain jacket is the cornerstone of a wet-weather kit. It has to strike an impossible balance between keeping water out and letting heat escape — on a long climb you'll soak yourself from the inside before the rain ever gets through.",
