                          "fill": "$text-zinc-400",
                          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                          "width": "fill_container",
                          "content": "Every Learn page is one .md file rendered into the same template: Page Header from frontmatter, this prose column, an On-this-page list built from the H2s, and More in Learn. Supported: lead (first paragraph), H2, H3, paragraph, lists, tables, blockquote, :::tip callout, image with caption, links. Nothing else is needed in frontmatter.",
