                                  "width": "fill_container",
                                  "descendants": {
                                    "iqLdU": {
                                      "content": "The Flèche is randonneuring's team event: no common route and no common start. Each team plans its own way to Minsk, rides it together through the first night of the year, and arrives at Nemiga in the morning. It counts towards ACP awards like any brevet."
                                    }
                                  }
                                },
                                {
                                  "id": "QIWGV",
                                  "type": "ref",
