                              "fill": "$text-zinc-300",
                              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                              "width": "fill_container",
                              "content": "No. Any bicycle propelled only by the rider is allowed — road, gravel, touring, recumbent or tandem. It needs working lights and brakes, and it should be comfortable for many hours.",
