                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "Headings: Overpass 700–900, often uppercase. Body and UI: Montserrat (same as Brevly), so only the heading face and colors swap. Radii follow what rbelby's components actually render — 8 / 16 / 24 with pill buttons — not the 4 / 8 / 16 in its DESIGN.md.",
                      "lineHeight": 1.5,
                      "fontFamily": "$font-sans",
                      "fontSize": 14,
                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                    }
                  ]
                }
